\pnlcltr\pnstart1\pnindent720\pnhang {\pntxtb (}{\pntxta )}}{\*\pnseclvl9\pnlcrm\pnstart1\pnindent720\pnhang {\pntxtb (}{\pntxta )}}\pard\plain \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid5799526 
\fs24\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\b\fs36\insrsid5799526 
\par }\pard \qc \li0\ri0\sl360\slmult1\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid8344506 {\b\fs32\insrsid5799526\charrsid5799526 EXECUTIVE SUMMARY}{\b\fs32\insrsid5799526 
\par }\pard \ql \li0\ri0\sl360\slmult1\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid10553261 {\insrsid16410299 
\par }{\insrsid10553261 The project is based solely on the design of a structural steel support member. The choice of either a Braithwaite water tank or glass reinforced plastic tank is to be made on the basis of economics.
\par 
\par The designed tank has a capacity of 327.6m}{\super\insrsid10553261 3}{\insrsid10553261  and it is o
f dimension 10m x 8.75m x 3.75m.  Glass reinforced plastic water tank has been chosen for the design on the basis of econmics. It is recyclable and has a low maintenance cost.
\par 
\par }{\insrsid4870402 The tank is placed}{\insrsid10553261  on beams , held in position by columns. The supporting structure consists of six 457 x191x 89 UB longitudinal beams(intermediate), two 457 x 191 x 67 UB  longitudinal beams(end) , two 406 x 178 }{
\insrsid4870402 x 54 UB transverse beams,and eighteen 254 x 254 x 132 UC columns each of length 4m.}{\insrsid10553261 
\par 
\par The longitudinal beams are spaced at a distance of 1.25m whiles the transverse beams are spaced at 7.5m
\par 
\par Combination of weld and bolts have been used for the design connections. All possible che}{\insrsid4870402 cks have been made to ensure maximum}{\insrsid10553261  safety of the structure.
\par }{\insrsid4865201 
\par The total project cost is 2,041,915,757 billion cedis ( 204,191.58 New GH cedis ). Engineering services amounted to 185,628,705 million cedis ( 18,562.87  New GH cedis ). Contingencies were allowed in order to cater for any unforeseen event}{
\insrsid4870402 s}{\insrsid4865201  that may occur.
\par }{\insrsid14973482 
\par }{\insrsid10553261\charrsid10553261 
\par }\pard \qc \li0\ri0\sl360\slmult1\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid8344506 {\b\fs32\insrsid12199814 
\par }{\b\fs36\insrsid5799526 
\par 
\par }\pard \ql \li0\ri0\sl360\slmult1\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid8344506 {\b\fs36\insrsid10553261 
\par }\pard \qc \li0\ri0\sl360\slmult1\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid8344506 {\b\fs36\insrsid12133299\charrsid3743007 CHAPTER ONE}{\b\fs36\insrsid5192011 
\par }\pard \ql \li0\ri0\sl360\slmult1\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid8344506 {\b\fs32\insrsid12199814 
\par }{\b\fs32\insrsid12133299\charrsid3743007 INTRODUCTION}{\b\fs36\insrsid12133299\charrsid5192011 
\par }{\b\fs28\insrsid5192011 
\par }{\b\fs28\insrsid3959875 1.1 }{\b\fs28\insrsid12133299 BACKGROUND INFORMATION}{\b\fs28\insrsid12133299\charrsid5127264 
\par }{\fs28\insrsid5192011 
\par }\pard \ql \li720\ri0\sl360\slmult1\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0\pararsid8344506 {\insrsid12133299 
The Kumasi Metropolitan Assembly acting through the College of Engineering, KNUST as agent of the client is implementing an Urban Infrastructure Upgrading at Old Tafo, a suburb of Kumasi with a credit facility from the World Bank.
\par }\pard \ql \li0\ri0\sl360\slmult1\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid8344506 {\insrsid12133299 
\par }\pard \ql \li720\ri0\sl360\slmult1\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0\pararsid8344506 {\insrsid12133299 Messrs Civil Engineering Consultants (ED IV Civil}{\insrsid4273072 ,}{\insrsid12133299 Group}{\insrsid4273072  13}{
\insrsid12133299 ) have been commissioned by Kumasi Metropolitan Assembly to undertake the stud}{\insrsid14687025 ies and designs for the project at Old Tafo.}{\insrsid12133299 
\par }\pard \ql \li0\ri0\sl360\slmult1\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid8344506 {\insrsid5192011 
\par 
\par }{\insrsid12133299  }{\b\fs28\insrsid1523812 1.2}{\b\fs28\insrsid3959875  }{\b\fs28\insrsid3486541  }{\b\fs28\insrsid12133299\charrsid5127264 PROJECT OBJECTIVE}{\insrsid12133299\charrsid5192011 
\par }{\insrsid12133299 
\par }\pard \ql \li720\ri0\sl360\slmult1\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0\pararsid8344506 {\insrsid12133299 The project is to improve urban living conditions with regards to enviro
nment, health, sanitation, drainage, vehicular and access, and solid and liquid waste management with special emphasis on the urban poor, in line with the Government Poverty Reduction Strategy. 
\par }\pard \ql \li0\ri0\sl360\slmult1\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid8344506 {\insrsid12133299 
\par }\pard \ql \li720\ri0\sl360\slmult1\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0\pararsid8344506 {\insrsid12133299 A structural steel support is to be designe}{\insrsid13245314 d to carry an overhead tank whi}{\insrsid14168814 
ch will receive water from an underground }{\insrsid12133299 water reservoir}{\insrsid13245314 .}{\insrsid12133299  }{\insrsid13245314 The overhead tank will then distribute water to people of Old Tafo under gravity.
\par }\pard \ql \li0\ri0\sl360\slmult1\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid8344506 {\b\fs28\insrsid5192011 
\par 
\par }{\b\fs28\insrsid12199814 
\par 
\par 
\par 
\par }{\b\fs28\insrsid1523812 1.3 }{\b\fs28\insrsid1523812\charrsid5127264 SCOPE OF WORK
\par }{\insrsid1523812 
\par }\pard \ql \li720\ri0\sl360\slmult1\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0\pararsid8344506 {\insrsid1523812 
With regards to the design of structural elements of the proposed project, it is required that an elevated tank be provided to supplement an underground water reservoir. The elevated tank is to be either Braithwaite or Glass Reinforced Plastic (GRP) type 
suppo}{\insrsid7630578 rted by structural steel member}{\insrsid1523812 . On the basis of economics of the two tanks, it is required to recommend one appropriately. }{\insrsid7630578 
\par }\pard \ql \li0\ri0\sl360\slmult1\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid8344506 {\insrsid7630578 
\par }\pard \ql \li720\ri0\sl360\slmult1\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0\pararsid8344506 {\insrsid1523812 Appropriates structural steel suppor}{\insrsid10764474 t member}{\insrsid1523812  }{\insrsid10764474 is}{\insrsid1523812 
 required to be designed }{\insrsid10764474 to carry the overhead tank system.}{\insrsid1523812 
\par }\pard \ql \li0\ri0\sl360\slmult1\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid8344506 {\insrsid7630578 
\par }\pard \ql \li720\ri0\sl360\slmult1\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0\pararsid8344506 {\insrsid7630578 Bill of quantities and detailed drawings in relation to the proposed project are to be prepared as well.
\par }\pard \ql \li0\ri0\sl360\slmult1\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid8344506 {\insrsid5192011 
\par 
\par }{\b\fs28\insrsid1523812 1.4}{\b\fs28\insrsid3486541  }{\b\fs28\insrsid12133299\charrsid5127264 PROJECT SITE DESCRIPTION
\par }{\insrsid12133299 
\par }\pard \ql \li720\ri0\sl360\slmult1\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0\pararsid8344506 {\insrsid12133299 Old Tafo is a suburb of Kumasi. It is located between mile 3 and mile 4 on both sides along Kumasi-Mampong main road. I
t has an estimated population of 91397 with reference to 2000 base year. The area has houses built haphazardly on one side and some well defined houses built on the other side. It is a low income generating area.
\par }\pard \ql \li0\ri0\sl360\slmult1\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid8344506 {\b\fs28\insrsid12199814 
\par }{\b\fs28\insrsid1523812 1.5 }{\b\fs28\insrsid12133299\charrsid5127264 EXISTING CONDITIONS ON SITE
\par }\pard \ql \li720\ri0\sl360\slmult1\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0\pararsid8344506 {\insrsid12199814 
\par }{\insrsid12133299 There is no overhead tank in the area, hence no structural steel supp}{\insrsid16057341 ort member. There is no regular }{\insrsid12133299 
 flow of water in the area. Water flows well only in the early hours of the day. Since high pressures are needed to convey water to hilly areas, some residents who }{\insrsid1841464 are situated on the hilly lands}{\insrsid12133299 
 of the area do not even receive water at all. }{\insrsid4152890 This goes a long way to affect the way of life of the people. }{\insrsid12133299 
\par }\pard \ql \li0\ri0\sl360\slmult1\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid8344506 {\insrsid16057341 
\par }{\insrsid5799526 
\par }\pard \qc \li0\ri0\sl360\slmult1\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid8344506 {\b\fs36\insrsid16057341\charrsid16057341 CHAPTER TWO}{\b\fs36\insrsid16057341 
\par }\pard \ql \li0\ri0\sl360\slmult1\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid8344506 {\insrsid16057341 
\par }{\b\fs32\insrsid5185877\charrsid16713209  }{\b\fs32\insrsid12133299\charrsid16713209 METHODOLOGY
\par }\pard \ql \fi720\li0\ri0\sl360\slmult1\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid12199814 {\insrsid16057341 For the}{\insrsid12133299  execution of the c}{\insrsid16057341 ontract, some processes were obeyed.}{\insrsid12133299 

\par }\pard \ql \li0\ri0\sl360\slmult1\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid8344506 {\b\fs28\insrsid5799526 
\par }{\b\fs28\insrsid16057341\charrsid4273072 2.1}{\b\fs28\insrsid4133903\charrsid4273072  }{\b\fs28\insrsid4273072 DESK STUDY}{\b\fs28\insrsid16057341\charrsid4273072 
\par }\pard \ql \li720\ri0\sl360\slmult1\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0\pararsid12199814 {\insrsid16057341 D}{\insrsid12133299 etailed investigation a}{\insrsid16057341 nd analysis of the project  was}{\insrsid12133299  made.}{
\insrsid4133903  Pieces of Information in relation to}{\insrsid16057341  Old Tafo }{\insrsid4133903 were studied and necessary tools needed to undertake the project were assembled.}{\insrsid12133299 
\par }\pard \ql \li0\ri0\sl360\slmult1\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid8344506 {\b\fs28\insrsid5799526 
\par }{\b\fs28\insrsid4273072 2.2 RECONNAISANCE SURVEY}{\b\fs28\insrsid4133903\charrsid4273072 
\par }{\insrsid4133903      
\par }\pard \ql \li720\ri0\sl360\slmult1\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0\pararsid8344506 {\insrsid4133903 A survey of the area was}{\insrsid12133299  done to help discover the existing conditions on the site. }{\insrsid4133903 
This helped}{\insrsid12133299  }{\insrsid4133903    }{\insrsid12133299  us to know t}{\insrsid4133903 he extent of development the site needs. A good survey of the site}{\insrsid12133299  also hel}{\insrsid4133903 ped}{\insrsid12133299 
 us to know the nature of the terrain, thereby having good knowledge about possible locations in the area for the erection of the  structural steel}{\insrsid4133903  support}{\insrsid12133299  member.
\par }\pard \ql \li0\ri0\sl360\slmult1\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid8344506 {\b\fs28\insrsid5799526 
\par }{\b\fs28\insrsid6911412\charrsid16713209 2.3}{\b\fs28\insrsid1248867\charrsid16713209  }{\b\fs28\insrsid4273072\charrsid16713209 DATA COLLECTION}{\b\fs28\insrsid6911412\charrsid12199814 
\par }\pard \ql \li720\ri0\sl360\slmult1\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0\pararsid8344506 {\insrsid6911412 It }{\insrsid12133299 is also an important aspect of the methodology. In consultation with my group members, data }{
\insrsid6911412  was}{\insrsid1248867  }{\insrsid12133299 collected and analysed to help us detect good and suitable locations for the construction }{\insrsid15098499 of the structural steel support.}{\insrsid12133299 
\par }{\insrsid1248867 
\par Other sources including organizations and books were sought to know the nat}{\insrsid12409604 ure of loadings that will come o}{\insrsid1248867 nto the structure. 
\par }\pard \ql \li0\ri0\sl360\slmult1\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid8344506 {\insrsid10895480 
