\par }\pard \ql \li720\ri0\sl360\slmult1\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0\pararsid8344506 {\insrsid10179570 The slab which will carry the total weight}{\insrsid4273072  of the tank a
nd water has two transverse beams, eight longitudinal beams and six}{\insrsid10179570  columns. The longitudinal beams collect the load from the tank and direct them to the transver}{\insrsid4273072 se beams. The transverse beams }{\insrsid10179570 
then transfer the loads to the columns. The columns finally transfer the columns to the foundation base.}{\insrsid16713209  }{\insrsid11866270 
\par }{\insrsid16713209 
\par The supporting structure has a pipe system running below the ground level. These pipes are held in place mass concrete. The pipe system consists of valves, over flow pipe, outlet pipe, inlet pipe }{\insrsid5707894 wash out pipe.}{
\insrsid5707894\charrsid5707894  }{\insrsid5707894 The structural steel support member has a ladder connected to it. 
\par }\pard \ql \li0\ri0\sl360\slmult1\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid8344506 {\b\fs28\insrsid5799526 
