\par }{\insrsid4273072 As part of the project, either a Braithwaite or Glass Reinforced Plastic type elevated tank is to be recommended on the basis of economics.
\par 
\par Glass Reinforced Plastic elevated tank is preferred due to the properties listed below. They include
\par 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\f3\insrsid4273072 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}}\pard \ql \fi-360\li720\ri0\sl360\slmult1\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx720\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls2\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0\pararsid8344506 {\insrsid4273072 Inexpensive
 to produce
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\f3\insrsid10497655 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}}{\insrsid10497655 It is rugged (strong)
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\f3\insrsid4273072 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}}{\insrsid4273072 Does not rust
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\f3\insrsid10497655 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}}{\insrsid10497655 It is light to handle}{\insrsid4273072  (low density)
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\f3\insrsid5701976 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}}{\insrsid5701976 It is non-corrosive, therefore it is ideal}{\insrsid1537786  for}{\insrsid5701976  harsh climatic conditions or where water quality is poor.}{\insrsid10497655 

\par {\listtext\pard\plain\f3\insrsid4273072 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}}{\insrsid4273072 High strength and durability
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\f3\insrsid4273072 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}It is recyclable
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\f3\insrsid4273072 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}It has relatively low maintenance cost
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\f3\insrsid4273072 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}It has long life span
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\f3\insrsid4273072 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}It does not promote the growth of algae and fungi
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\f3\insrsid5701976 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}}{\insrsid5701976 It is ideal for site use with restricted access.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\f3\insrsid5701976 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}It requires a minimum number of skilled men to assemble it.}{\insrsid4273072 
\par }\pard \ql \li360\ri0\sl360\slmult1\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin360\itap0\pararsid8344506 {\insrsid5701976 
\par }\pard \ql \li0\ri0\sl360\slmult1\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid8344506 {\insrsid4273072 Since it is inexpensive to produce, it\rquote 
s cost effective is relatively better. Since it does not rust and recyclable, it gives it a long life span. Maintenance is also affordable and very safe for the purpose of storing drinking water because it does not promote the growth of algae and fungi. 

\par }{\insrsid14974453 
\par Apart from the standard panel sizes, individual needs can be m}{\insrsid12207778 et by the production of other}{\insrsid14974453  panel}{\insrsid12207778 s with sizes different from the standard ones.}{\insrsid4273072 
